      "value": "<p><em>Champions Guild Automation:</em> A 10-ft-radius pillar of light while you concentrate. Each creature in it when it appears, that enters it, or that ends its turn there is bathed once per turn: your allies regain 4d12 + your spellcasting modifier Hit Points, everyone else makes a DEX save against 6d12 Radiant (half on a success). +1d12 per slot level above 7th. Drag the pillar up to 30 ft when you move.</p>",
